        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Hager 5100 Heavy Duty commercial door closer. </b>\r\n<p>\r\nGrade 1.  Adjustable valving. Non-handed. Hardware included.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Dimensions: <a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/5100_Install.pdf?v=1704263625\">Specifications Diagram (PDF).</a></b>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Certifications:</b> BHMA Certified ANSI A156.4, Grade 1.<br>\r\nADA Compliant ANSI A117.1 Accessibility Code.<br>\r\nUL/cUL listed for up to 3 hours.<br>\r\nUL10C Positive Pressure Rated<br>\r\nUL10B Neutral Pressure Rated<br>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Closer Body:</b> Cast iron.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Springs:</b> Onc piece seamless steel spring tube seals in hydraulic fluid.<br>\r\nDouble heat treated steel, tempered springs.<br>\r\nPrecision machined, heat treated steel piston.<br>\r\nTriple heat treated steel spindle<br>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Valves:</b> Adjustable latching and sweep speed valve.<br>\r\nAdjustable backcheck valve.<br>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Cover:</b>Full plastic cover is standadrd.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Arms & Brackets:</b> Tri-pack, regular arms, top jamb and parallel arm is standard.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Fasteners:</b>Self tapping wood and machine screws, sex nuts and bolts are all standard.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Door Thickness:</b> 1 3/4 is standard.<br>\r\n1 3/8 - 2\" is optional.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/5100-chart.jpg?v=1704442264\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n</p>",
